| **2** | **A Window on Pantheon** – <https://www.booking.com/hotel/it/a-window-on-pantheon.html> | Pantheon area (≈ 500 m from the centre) | **Entire Apartment – 90 m²** – 5 beds, 2 bedrooms, 1 living‑room, 2 bathrooms | **US $3 070** (≈ US $614 /night) | **8.7 / 10 – “Fabulous”** (34 reviews) | Fully equipped kitchen, separate bedrooms, two bathrooms (great for families), rooftop terrace with city views, walking distance to Piazza Navona & Trevi Fountain. |
