| **4** | **Hotel Villa Pamphili Roma** – <https://www.booking.com/hotel/it/villa-pamphili-roma.html> | Villa Pamphili park (≈ 4.4 km from centre) – quiet residential area | **Standard Hotel Room – 2 beds** (can add extra roll‑away/sofa‑bed) | **US $1 401** (≈ US $280 /night) | **8.7 / 10 – “Fabulous”** (4 504 reviews) | Large green park next door (great for kids to run), free parking, breakfast buffet, family‑friendly staff, shuttle to Termini station (≈ 15 min). |
